          "request": {
            "name": "Make a call",
            "description": {
              "content": "Make a call using to any phone numbers. To place a new outbound call, make an HTTP POST request. At first it will initiate a call to an agent. Maximum waiting time for an agent to pick up the call is 20 seconds. After an agent picks up, we will automatically call desired phone number.",
